ndering code where available, separately from registering this new function. Implementation and review consume no simulation time and confer no mastery.\",\"experienceReview\":\"This read-only administrative inspection provides usable identities but does not itself establish new experimental information, produce an enjoyable performed experience or improve physical comfort. Award neither transient pleasure nor maintained satisfaction; inventory-inspected and inventory-inspection-stopped must not trigger discovery, practice or mastery rewards. Learning and registration also grant no wellbeing.\",\"visualReview\":\"Show a private paginated list of actual carried stacks with exact selectable IDs, quantities, resource labels and observable processing-state distinctions, including peeled cores versus intact branches only where state supports that distinction. Display page counts, current revision and unavailable/reserved status clearly. Preserve the recorded result in replay; add no world objects, processing animation or implied material changes.\",\"learning\":1}]}","annotations":[],"logprobs":[]}],"phase":"final_answer"}],"error":null,"incomplete_details":null,"tools":[],"tool_choice":"auto","parallel_tool_calls":true,"prompt_cache_key":"b2d7e6b1-30d0-4864-a8b3-2c8f87bf5529","prompt_cache_retention":"24h","text":{"format":{"type":"json_schema","name":"continuous_reviews","description":null,"schema":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"reviews":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"actor":{"type":"string"},"decision":{"type":"string","enum":["reuse","develop","reject"]},"ability":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}]},"reason":{"type":"string"},"specification":{"type":"string"},"experienceReview":{"type":"string"},"visualReview":{"type":"string"},"learning":{"type":"integer","minimum":0}},"required":["actor","decision","ability","reason","specification","experienceReview","visualReview","learn